---
import { Timer, Apple, Droplets, Moon, Dumbbell } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section id="pilares" class="py-24 px-6 bg-bg-surface/30">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight">
        Los 5 Pilares para tu Metamorfosis Real
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-secondary max-w-xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Nuestro método se basa en la optimización de los 5 sistemas biológicos
        fundamentales para tu transformación.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
      {/* Ayuno Intermitente */}
      <div
        class="glass p-8 group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent-blue/10"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent-blue mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          <Timer size={32} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-text-primary">
          Ayuno Intermitente
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Sincroniza tu metabolismo y activa la autofagia para una reparación
          celular profunda.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Alimentación */}
      <div
        class="glass p-8 group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent-blue/10"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent-blue mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          <Apple size={32} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-text-primary">Alimentación</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Nutre tu biología con alimentos densos que estabilicen tu energía y
          hormonas.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Hidratación */}
      <div
        class="glass p-8 group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent-blue/10"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent-blue mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          <Droplets size={32} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-text-primary">Hidratación</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Optimiza el equilibrio mineral y la conductividad celular para un
          rendimiento máximo.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Sueño */}
      <div
        class="glass p-8 group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent-blue/10"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent-blue mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          <Moon size={32} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-text-primary">Sueño</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Domina tu ritmo circadiano para una recuperación cognitiva y hormonal
          absoluta.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Ejercicio */}
      <div
        class="glass p-8 group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent-blue/10"
      >
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent-blue mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          <Dumbbell size={32} />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-text-primary">Ejercicio</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Construye fuerza y resiliencia metabólica a través del movimiento
          estratégico.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
